q=A.b([new A.eo("MIA","Open-source, local, privacy-first voice dictation for Windows. Press a global hotkey, speak, and MIA types polished text at your cursor in whatever app is focused. Everything runs on your machine (no cloud, no account, no server) and your voice never leaves the device. A fully offline alternative to Wispr Flow.","Built as a Tauri 2 desktop app with a Rust core (the engine) and a thin Svelte 5 webview used only for settings, onboarding, and the floating mic HUD. The live loop runs entirely on-device: global push-to-talk capture (cpal, 16 kHz mono), server-side Silero-VAD-gated warm whisper.cpp transcription, deterministic text cleanup (filler removal, spoken punctuation, sentence casing), and system-wide injection at the cursor via Windows SendInput with a clipboard fallback. pt-BR and English are first-class. Anti-hallucination is always on (VAD plus greedy decoding plus stateless per-utterance requests). Ships an optional NVIDIA CUDA engine (roughly 7 to 10x faster), a custom dictionary, voice-triggered snippets, per-app writing styles, first-run onboarding, and signed in-app auto-update (minisign-verified). GitHub Actions auto-bumps, tags, and publishes a signed Windows installer plus latest.json on every push to main.",o,o,o,B.Lr,B.mn,"https://guilhermeeng99.github.io/mia/"),new A.eo("Parrot","Local AI voice cloner for Windows. Parrot clones a voice from a few seconds of reference audio and speaks any text you type, entirely on your own machine. No accounts, no API keys, no cloud, and your reference audio never leaves your device. Free and open source (Apache-2.0).","Architected as three cooperating processes in one window: a Svelte UI, a Rust/Tauri shell that owns the window and supervises the engine, and a Python FastAPI sidecar running the PyTorch voice model over localhost. Clone-and-speak is built end to end: record or upload a reference sample, save it as a reusable voice profile, then type text and export natural speech as a .wav. Runs on CUDA or CPU (auto-detected) with a VRAM-budgeted GPU worker pool and flush-and-retry recovery. The first launch bootstraps a Python venv and downloads the voice model once, then works offline forever. Tested across all three layers (pytest for the sidecar, vitest plus svelte-check for the frontend, cargo test plus clippy for the shell) with a whole-app IPC smoke test. Signed-updater keypair and CI release pipeline wired.",o,o,o,B.MS,B.mB,"https://guilhermeeng99.github.io/parrot/"),new A.eo("Toolzy","Free, open-source native desktop toolbox for everyday file tasks: convert and resize images, work with PDFs (merge, compress, protect, images to and from PDF), convert and edit audio and video, transcribe speech, and download media from a link. Everything runs natively on your machine, so your files never leave your device.","Single Tauri 2 desktop app where Rust is the engine (conversion runs natively, not in a browser sandbox) and a thin React plus TypeScript webview calls Rust via invoke(). Image convert and resize use the Rust image and webp crates; PDF read and write use pdfium-render and printpdf with a qpdf sidecar for merge and AES-256 password protection; audio and video editing run through an ffmpeg sidecar; local speech transcription uses whisper.cpp with optional NVIDIA CUDA; the media downloader wraps yt-dlp. Pure helpers (resize math, filename and argument building) are isolated in their own modules with cargo tests, and the React UI holds no conversion logic. Licensing kept clean by design: no AGPL libraries bundled, with each native binary running as a separate sidecar process. CI runs Biome plus cargo test plus app and site builds, gated into a signed, self-updating Windows installer.",o,o,o,B.LX,B.mC,"https://guilhermeeng99.github.io/Toolzy/"),new A.eo("Investanco","Personal investment portfolio tracker for Android and Web. You register what you own (ticker, quantity, average price) across institutions, and Investanco automatically tracks current value, profit/loss, and performance using public market-data APIs. No broker login and no scraping: the only manual data is your holdings, which change rarely.","Built on Clean Architecture with flutter_bloc, get_it, and go_router. Firestore is the source of truth and a local Drift (SQLite) cache is rebuilt at sign-in so reads render immediately, then refresh in the background (it runs on web via sqlite3 WASM). Automatic valuation computes per-holding market value, profit/loss, and return, with fixed-income accrual (CDI, Selic, prefixed, IPCA+) modeled as dated cash flows. Aggregates live and historical prices, FX, and rate series from six public sources (brapi.dev, CoinGecko, Finnhub, Tesouro Direto, BCB SGS, AwesomeAPI). Features user-defined allocation classes with target percentages and a rebalancing plan, bulk CSV import for assets and transactions with a review screen, daily snapshots for history, and Firebase Auth (Google) with a single-owner lock. Charts via fl_chart, functional error handling via dartz (Either), i18n via slang, and API tokens injected at build time through dart-define.",o,o,o,B.Kq,B.mA,"https://guilhermeeng99.github.io/Investanco/"),new A.eo("Truth or Dare X","Party game app where friends challenge each other through classic 'Truth or Dare' prompts. Reached 1M+ downloads through tight session loops and share-driven distribution.","Implemented the UI, hundreds of curated prompts across multiple categories, multiplayer session management, and social sharing features. Integrated ad monetization (rewarded + interstitial) and analytics to optimize engagement and revenue per session.",B.c0,"1M+",o,B.es,B.mo,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11Dj0-tAeB0LPlH9yPZUon_XQVrOVAf-l/view?usp=drive_link"),new A.eo("Harvest","Fresh food e-commerce app connecting local farmers directly with their communities. Perishable-first product catalog with a fast, reliable shopping experience, shipped end-to-end in a 24-hour AI-assisted build.","Architected with Clean Architecture and a feature-first structure across 13 features for long-term scalability and maintainability. Implemented Firebase Auth with email/password and Google Sign-In using platform-specific OAuth flows (popup on web, credential on mobile). Built a reusable UI component system with 8+ shared widgets and a complete Material 3 design system (Fresh Harvest palette, Poppins/Inter typography). Designed a centralized BLoC startup coordinator that pre-loads all data before navigation, eliminating per-page loading states. Structured a role-based admin system via a secure Firestore collection guarded by server-side security rules. Wrote 48+ unit tests covering domain entities, repository cache logic, and BLoC state machines with bloc_test and mocktail.",o,o,new A.nV("Production-Ready App 24-Hours-AI","https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/i-built-production-ready-app-24-hours-using-ai-heres-what-passos-e6fcf/"),B.Lw,B.mz,"https://guilhermeeng99.github.io/harvest/"),new A.eo("Drop & Merge","Drop-and-merge puzzle game combining strategic placement with satisfying merge mechanics for a tight, engaging casual loop.","Implemented the complete UI layer with smooth merge animations, drop physics feedback, and responsive grid interactions. Tuned rendering for stable frame times on low-end Android devices.",B.c0,o,o,B.es,B.mt,"https://appmagic.rocks/iphone/drop-and-merge/1559407907"),new A.eo("Blu BI","Business Intelligence app for tracking and visualizing financial data: revenue, expenses, and project-based results with charts, Income Statement (DRE) reports, and period analysis. Multiplatform (Android, iOS, Web, Windows, macOS, Linux).","Built on Clean Architecture with self-contained feature modules (auth, finance, projects, company, personal) registered via GetX bindings. Implemented Google Sign-In with biometric (local_auth) protection, offline-first persistence via Isar, REST integration via Dio, and Firebase Remote Config for feature flags. Built dashboards and analytics with fl_chart: revenue/expense bar and pie charts, project-level financial breakdowns, money goals per category, and period-based reporting. Used Freezed + json_serializable for immutable models and get_it for dependency injection. Responsive layouts adapt cleanly from mobile to desktop. Stack: Flutter \u2022 GetX (state + navigation) \u2022 Firebase Auth + Google Sign-In \u2022 Firebase Remote Config \u2022 Dio \u2022 Isar \u2022 fl_chart \u2022 Freezed + json_serializable \u2022 get_it \u2022 local_auth.",o,o,o,B.LF,B.mD,o),new A.eo("Booze","Drinking party game with creative challenges, mini-games, and social mechanics designed for fun group gatherings. Reached 500K+ downloads through friend-driven discovery.","Implemented the UI, diverse challenge modes, customizable game rules, and group-play mechanics. Built smooth animations, ad monetization (rewarded + interstitial), and Firebase analytics to track engagement and session data.",B.c0,"500K+",o,B.es,B.mx,"https://appmagic.rocks/iphone/booze-jogo-de-bebida/1495727658?hl=en"),new A.eo("Never Have I Ever X","Party game app where players uncover surprising facts about each other through classic 'Never Have I Ever' rounds. Reached 500K+ downloads on the back of share-driven viral loops.","Implemented the UI, hundreds of curated questions across multiple categories, and social sharing features. Integrated ad monetization (rewarded + interstitial) and analytics to optimize engagement and revenue per session.",B.c0,"500K+",o,B.es,B.mE,"https://appmagic.rocks/iphone/never-have-i-ever-x/1467821712")],s)
